## Why This Is Asked
Tests knowledge of practical data validation, versioned schemas, and end-to-end observability in a streaming pipeline. It also exercises handling of invalid data with a DLQ and a backfill workflow, plus LocalStack testing.

## Key Concepts
- Kinesis Data Streams
- DynamoDB as a lightweight schema registry
- Lambda data validation
- S3 Parquet storage with partitions
- DLQ handling
- X-Ray tracing

## Code Example
