- LocalStack test planning for end-to-end validation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-Lambda handler sketch to attach provenance
function handler(event){ 
  const provenance = { eventId: event.id, deviceId: event.device, firmwareVersion: event.fw, ingestionTs: Date.now(), pipelineId: 'proc-1' };
  event.provenance = provenance;
  return event;
}
```

